<title>PHILIPPINES: Forum Pacific up 18 pct on buy-in talk.</title>
<headline>Forum Pacific up 18 pct on buy-in talk.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forum Pacific Inc, formerly Cophil Exploration Corp, jumped by 24 centavos, or 18 percent, to 1.58 pesos in mid-session on Tuesday on talks of a buy-in by a foreign investor, brokers said.</p>
<p>Forum president Peter Salud told Reuters that talks are ongoing with interested investors but he declined to disclose details.</p>
<p>&quot;We are talking to some but all of these are still in the works,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
